<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n44540" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">sōbrĭĕtas</span></b> ,
			ātis, f.
		sobrius, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>sobriety</i> (post-Aug.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<b>Lit.</b>, <i>temperance</i> in
			drinking, <i><span class="en">Sen. Tranq. 15, 16</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Val. Max. 6,
				3, 9</span></i>.— 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Hence Sobrietas personified,</span>”
				<i>the enemy of Venus</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">App. M. 5, p. 172, 20</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">Prud. Psych.
			450</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			In gen., <i>moderation</i>, <i>temperance</i>, <i>continence</i> (cf.: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">modestas, temperantia): vitae,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Dig.
					1, 7, 17 <i>fin.</i></span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">Vulg. 1 Tim. 2,
			9</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>B.</b>
			<b>Trop.</b>, <i>reasonableness</i>,
				<i>prudence</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">consiliorum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Amm. 31, 10, 19</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
